1
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,630
(door rattles)

2
00:00:07,629 --> 00:00:09,299
(knocking on the door)

3
00:00:13,135 --> 00:00:15,065
(Man with Flowers:)Thank you.

4
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,100
(Sheldon:)No, thank you.

5
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:19,905
(Sheldon:)Delivery men are
the unsung foot soldiers

6
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:21,178
(Sheldon:)of our nation's commerce.

7
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:24,106
(Sheldon:)It's because
of people like you,

8
00:00:24,112 --> 00:00:27,652
(Sheldon:)people like me can limit
our human contact.

9
00:00:27,649 --> 00:00:30,379
(Sheldon:)I'd shake your hand,
but, well, you know.

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:35,020
(Man:)I'm not a delivery man,
I-I'm a doctor.

11
00:00:35,023 --> 00:00:36,753
(Man:)Although I do
often deliver

12
00:00:36,758 --> 00:00:39,928
(Man:)alarming biopsy results
to my patients.

13
00:00:41,963 --> 00:00:44,863
(Sheldon:)That's humorous.

14
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:46,936
(Man:)All right.

15
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:51,910
Yeah, I-I bet you leave
your patients in stitches.

16
00:00:54,509 --> 00:00:58,049
(Sheldon:)That was
also humorous.

17
00:00:58,046 --> 00:01:01,026
(Man:)All right.

